@startuml
[*] --> Order : plane acquired

Order --> Arrival : delivered
Arrival --> Preparation : arrived

Preparation --> Operations : ready for ops
Preparation --> Maintenance : needs maintenance

Operations --> Operations : still in use (scheduled flights)
Operations --> Maintenance : no more flights or maintenance needed

Maintenance --> Preparation : checked and serviced

Operations --> Withdrawn : out of service
Maintenance --> Withdrawn : out of service

Withdrawn --> [*] : process complete
@enduml
